{
    "title": "Kick Giant: Giant Hunter",
    "description": "Meet a fun crush-ing game! It's time to take up arms! Defeat them if you can!\r\n\r\nKick Giant is an antidepressant game. If you're feeling stressed or angry, these toys will help you. \r\n\r\nPerhaps you like winning battles? Tap the giants and release your anger. Start the fight and strike to earn coins!  \r\n\r\nWant to hit the boss? Smash the giant\u2019s head with a hammer or take a flamethrower to set the giant on fire!\r\nHaving a bad day? Grab your weapons and beat the giants! Launch a toilet right in the giants\u2019 faces.\r\n\r\n\u0421rush, slap, cut to destroy the giants. Defeat the giant to complete the level. Get coins when a giant is knocked out. Upgrade your arsenal and unlock new heroes! Earn lots of coins in this casual & idle game!\r\n\r\nGame features: \r\n- Simple controls & gameplay\r\n- Hilarious characters and punching sounds\r\n- Different weapons to choose from\r\n\r\nAre you ready to defeat all the crazy giants? Become the master of slicing and shooting as the giants must be destroyed!\r\n\r\nHit, shoot and crush! Fight colorful and crazy giants with the funniest weapons: fish, paintball gun, rockets, banana launcher, duck, arrows, flamethrower, and more! Use the power of weapons and enjoy it.\r\n\r\nRelax & unwind or beat them all! Download and play this 3D simulator game. Kill your spare time and have fun!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Meet a fun crush-ing game! It&#39;s time to take up arms! Defeat them if you can!<br><br>Kick Giant is an antidepressant game. If you&#39;re feeling stressed or angry, these toys will help you. <br><br>Perhaps you like winning battles? Tap the giants and release your anger. Start the fight and strike to earn coins!  <br><br>Want to hit the boss? Smash the giant\u2019s head with a hammer or take a flamethrower to set the giant on fire!<br>Having a bad day? Grab your weapons and beat the giants! Launch a toilet right in the giants\u2019 faces.<br><br>\u0421rush, slap, cut to destroy the giants. Defeat the giant to complete the level. Get coins when a giant is knocked out. Upgrade your arsenal and unlock new heroes! Earn lots of coins in this casual &amp; idle game!<br><br>Game features: <br>- Simple controls &amp; gameplay<br>- Hilarious characters and punching sounds<br>- Different weapons to choose from<br><br>Are you ready to defeat all the crazy giants? Become the master of slicing and shooting as the giants must be destroyed!<br><br>Hit, shoot and crush! Fight colorful and crazy giants with the funniest weapons: fish, paintball gun, rockets, banana launcher, duck, arrows, flamethrower, and more! Use the power of weapons and enjoy it.<br><br>Relax &amp; unwind or beat them all! Download and play this 3D simulator game. Kill your spare time and have fun!",
